	-- was: ["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 28 {item:2605} (28s); about 28s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817}). If you smelt the 195 {item:3859} yourself ({skill:186} 165: an {item:3575} and a Coal each), buy 195 Coal too (9g 75s, trade and blacksmithing suppliers); skip them if you buy the bars."] = "이 구간에 필요한 몫을 한 번에 사세요: {item:2605} 28개(28실버). 모두 약 28실버. 화살표가 진영의 가장 가까운 판매자를 가리킵니다({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286}, {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367}, {npc:5817}). 195개의 {item:3859}을(를) 직접 제련한다면({skill:186} 165: {item:3575} 하나와 석탄 하나) 석탄 195개도 사세요(9골드 75실버, 무역 및 대장기술 용품 상인). 주괴를 산다면 건너뛰세요."
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 28 {item:2605} (28s); about 28s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: Borya, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817}). If you smelt the 195 {item:3859} yourself ({skill:186} 165: an {item:3575} and a Coal each), buy 195 Coal too (9g 75s, trade and blacksmithing suppliers); skip them if you buy the bars."] = "",

