	["{item:12823} teaches {item:12775} ({skill:164} 255) for 2g. Sold by {npc:11278} ({zone:1422}). {npc:11278} is a ghost: you see him only with the {item:13544} on (from {npc:11216}'s {area:2057} chain, level 55, a group), so skip this without it."] = "{item:12823}은(는) {item:12775}을(를) 가르칩니다({skill:164} 255), 2골드. {npc:11278}({zone:1422})이(가) 판매합니다. {npc:11278}은(는) 유령입니다: {item:13544}을(를) 착용해야만 보입니다({npc:11216}의 {area:2057} 연계, 55레벨, 파티). 없으면 건너뛰십시오.",

